				}
				cost: {
					type: addBurdens
					amount: 1
				}
				effect: {
					type: modifyStrength
					select: self
					amount: {
						type: cardAffectedLimitPerPhase
						limit: 3
						source: 3
					}
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: <b>Burglar</b>.<br>When you discard a card from hand to transfer a follower, you may draw 2 cards.<br><b>Skirmish:</b> If Bilbo is skirmishing Smaug or Gollum, add a doubt to make Bilbo strength +3 (limit +3).
